  "description": "Regression set moved from the retired 2agent cs/deploy (2026-11-11): 22 cases on the `support` Soot (live-chat + lohi-cs) against the Lohi api support fixture reader. Writes are dry_run except the recovery/fix cases, which need their approval set to auto. Tags split train/val/test for soot train.",
